quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kell_Tamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1432360-just-got-my-copy-of-fangs-at-the-gate?p=1433574#post1433574\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Anyone who had it say shipping label printed but nothing else happen get it yet? I'm still waiting and the shipping label was made on the 14th of January. Just curious if I need to start asking about it or its just mail being slow.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Mine was created on the 11th. As far as USPS reports, it's not been picked up yet. Considering how swamped the USPS is these days, I'm not real surprised it's taking awhile. I know another (non-OPP) KS I backed said to wait two months from your label creation date to start letting them know if you hadn't seen movement.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-27T06:51:22-08:00","id":1433608,"title":"","content":"Got it yesterday, sooooo happy.<br /> (Got shipped to Europe, if that information is relevant to anyone)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/903-cheshire-cat","name":"Cheshire Cat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar903_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"502"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-29T08:24:46-08:00","id":1433798,"title":"","content":"I still haven't gotten mine from Drivethrurpg. Supposedly shipped for the 2nd time on December 29th, and I have already contacted and yelled at them twice...seriously what the hell.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1635-citadel97501","name":"Citadel97501","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"544"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-31T17:06:56-08:00","id":1434059,"title":"","content":"My tracker finally changed and said I should be getting mine on the 6th. Glad to know I wasn't the only one who was having delays. Hope everyone else gets theirs soon as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1777-kell_tamer","name":"Kell_Tamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1777_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-01T20:58:22-08:00","id":1434221,"title":"","content":"Just got mine today.<br /> <br /> Mail in America is really slow right now. In some places it's fine but in others there's a lot of slowdowns. They got rid of a lot of sorting machines before the election, then got slammed by the holidays. I was getting Christmas stuff well into January and only last week did I get a stimulus check which got sent out the 6th.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-04T13:00:53-08:00","id":1434517,"title":"","content":"I got mine today. It knew it was going to look good. But damn if it isn't gorgeous.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/753-ariketh","name":"Ariketh","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"66"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-04T19:17:14-08:00","id":1434553,"title":"","content":"I got mine yesterday and agreed!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1777-kell_tamer","name":"Kell_Tamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1777_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-04T21:48:44-08:00","id":1434555,"title":"","content":"Got mine yesterday as well. Super happy with it, as well as my canvas map.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24445-arkayriel","name":"Arkayriel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"122"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-05T06:23:12-08:00","id":1434592,"title":"","content":"I got mine as well! Letting it warm up from outside temps before I open it. I'm afraid the binding will crack or something.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":